excalibur-control-center (0.5.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Debian 13 / Ubuntu 24.04 packaging: GUI package and DKMS source package.
  * Fix the DKMS hook scripts to derive the module version from the installed
    /usr/src/excalibur-wmi-* directory instead of a hard-coded version.
  * Drop the spurious hard dependency of the GUI on dkms (the GUI is read-only
    and works without the driver; the driver is pulled in via Recommends).

